      "Title: ServiceNow Change Request Filter Construction\nDescription: Steps to build an AND filter on the Change Request list page using specific fields and values.\n- Open the filter panel by clicking the 'Show / hide filter' control (bid a47) on the change_request_list.do page.\n- Select the first field from the 'All of these conditions must be met. -- choose field --' combobox (bid a1181).\n- Choose 'Type' from the field dropdown and set its value to 'Normal' using the option chooser.\n- Click the 'Add AND Condition To Condition 1' button (e.g., bid a1303) to append the next requirement.\n- Select 'Requested by' from the new condition's field chooser and fill the value textbox with 'System Administrator'.\n- Click the 'Add AND Condition To Condition 2' button (e.g., bid a1781) to continue the chain.\n- Select 'Model' from the field chooser and set the operator to 'is empty string' to match empty entries.\n- Click the 'Add AND Condition To Condition 3' button (e.g., bid a2257) to prepare for the 'Short description' condition."
